OL,3,GNEWSAThe hidden palace where royalty
OL,4,Aonce slept
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was once owned by King Henry VIII
OL,7,Fand used to be bigger than Hampton
OL,8,FCourt.
OL,10,FBut today only a solitary tower and
OL,11,Fgatehouse remain of Otford Palace, near
OL,12,FSevenoaks.
OL,14,FAnd, while few outside that part of
OL,15,FKent probably know of this hidden royal
OL,16,Flandmark, in its 16th Century heyday it
OL,17,Fwas considered "one of the most
OL,18,Fmagnificent houses in England" and a
OL,19,Fstopover hotspot for those of high
OL,20,Fstatus.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
