OL,3,GNEWSAThe hidden palace where royalty
OL,4,Aonce slept
OL,5,
OL,6,FCurrently being transformed into a hub
OL,7,Ffor historic study and the arts,
OL,8,Ftrustee Nick Rushby described it to
OL,9,FSecret Kent as "iconic" and having been
OL,10,Flike "the Hilton Hotel" of its time.
